"<p>It does not take into account devfs or resmgr, or similar. In most cases "
"this is not a problem, but on some systems the permissions may be altered "
"the next time you login or restart your computer. In these cases it is best "
"to consult the distribution's documentation."
"<p>The important task that K3bSetup 2 performs is grant write access to the "
"CD and DVD devices."
"<p><b>Caution:</b> Although K3bSetup 2 should not be able to damage your "
"system, no guarantee can be given."
msgstr ""

