"K3b will create a multisession cd with 2 sessions. The first session will "
"contain all audio tracks and the second session will contain a mode 2 form 1 "
"data track."
"<p>This mode is based on the <em>Blue book</em> standard (also known as "
"<em>Extended Audio CD</em>, <em>CD-Extra</em>, or <em>CD Plus</em>) and has "
"the advantage that a hifi audio cd player will just recognize the first "
"session and ignore the second session with the data track."
"<p>If the cd is intended to be used in a hifi audio cd player this is the "
"recommended mode."
